            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A glass container forming system (10) and method (200, 300, 400, 500) for operating a glass container forming system. The glass container forming system includes: a plurality of workstations (12), each of which includes an equipment area (30) and zone partitioning (16); one or more object detectors (56) configured to obtain sensor data of an operator access area of one or more of the plurality of workstations, and/or a carriage (20) carrying a robot (24); a plurality of glass container forming machines (14) located within the plurality of workstations; and a control system for performing the method and/or otherwise operating the glass container forming machine.</p>
